  "body": "Deadline Sale: Friday, 18 September 2026 at 4:00 PM (unless sold prior).\r\n\r\n41 Rue D'Amarres, Gulf Harbour presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium waterfront section within the exclusive gated enclave of Cap D'Amarres.\r\n\r\nComplete with its own substantial private berth measuring approximately 22m x 7m, together with a flat, easy-building site, this is a compelling opportunity for buyers looking to create an exceptional coastal residence in one of Auckland's most prestigious marina addresses.\r\n\r\nSurrounded by quality homes in a tightly held gated community, this exceptional site offers the scale, position and waterfront lifestyle discerning buyers will immediately recognise. Privacy, security and direct access to the water combine to create a genuinely special setting.\r\n\r\nImagine a bespoke home designed to maximise the marina outlook, with the water at your doorstep and sunset views forming part of everyday life. For boating enthusiasts, the generous private berth is a major advantage, offering the potential to accommodate a substantial vessel while providing effortless access to the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have previously explored plans for a substantial residence on the site, providing further inspiration as to what may be possible, subject to all necessary council, body corporate and other approvals. Established luxury residences nearby further reinforce the calibre and future potential of this address.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to Gulf Harbour marina amenities, cafés, restaurants, shops, private schooling and the ferry service to Auckland's CBD, this is a waterfront lifestyle opportunity offering both exclusivity and convenience.\r\n\r\nThe vendor's instructions are clear: SELL.\r\n\r\nIf you have been waiting for the right Gulf Harbour waterfront opportunity, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nPresent your offer now.\r\n\r\nContact Jacky Yu on 021 233 3771 or Yimin Guo on 022 474 1325 today.",
